WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:36.380
That a colony like Moon
Moon even exists is surprising,

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:39.270
but the Light Tribe living there
has a lot on its plate.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:41.040
I got kidnapped
and ended up...

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.180
having a meal with
Chara and a pretty girl.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:47.280
Finally, Gottn's mobile suit team showed up,

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.480
and as I get set up to be
the Light Tribe's new prophet,

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:54.180
I have to ask: are Rasara and
Sarasa the same person?!

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.090
THE PHANTOM COLONY

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.090
(Part 2)

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:04.510
Rasara?
What are you doing here?

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:07.370
Rasara? I am not her.

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:10.370
I am Sarasa Moon,
leader of the Light Tribe.

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:12.140
Lady Sarasa!

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:13.510
Lady Sarasa!

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:16.610
Enough, Role.
I wish to speak with this boy.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.180
Well... this can't
get much worse.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.130
She's the prophet?

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:23.750
Judau, you must
help me spread...

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:28.900
the teachings of light throughout
the universe as our messiah.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:30.460
Don't make fun of me!

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.060
- Hey.
- What?

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:34.930
Does she think
she can fool us like this?

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.700
The Light Tribe's prophet
will use your power...

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:43.500
to spread the tribe's
teachings across the cosmos.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.970
But if we do, we'll destroy
Moon Moon's peaceful way of life.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:52.280
Boy, give your life
to Moon Moon.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:55.680
Become my guide
to the outside.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.750
Miss Rasara, snap out of it!

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:00.700
You must be hypnotized!
Wake up!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.220
Soldiers!

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.860
Rasara! Wake up!

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:10.630
One such as this
cannot be our messiah!

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.920
Throw them in the dungeon!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.270
Captain?

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.910
These people are insane!
Get them!

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.160
Captain!

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:21.170
- Distract them!
- Right!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.710
- Stop!
- No, you don't!

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:29.180
Roux!

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.620
Open your skirt!

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.760
Emary!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.560
Emary!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.020
Captain!

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:52.240
Don't wait for us!
Oh, they didn't.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.810
Emary!

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:59.580
I'm okay.
I hurt inside, though.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.020
After them!
Don't let the children escape!

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:03.690
Captain!

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.350
Wait... I have a wife.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:06.750
Up!

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:10.660
Let's get back to the Argama.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:13.560
Except the Double Zeta's
standing in front of the temple.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.560
Why didn't I just get in it?

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.060
Because even a spear
can kill if it hits you.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.670
What's with that
Rasara girl, anyway?

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:24.570
- You fall for any girl who's kinda cute, Judau.
- Don't be stupid!

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:28.410
Which is why it'd be easy
for you to fall for me.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.580
Listen, I'm not looking to
start a fight with Beecha!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:35.480
It's not like Beecha and I
are engaged or anything!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.080
The thing is...

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:40.620
Beecha kind of implied
that you are.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.220
They're here!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.930
- Huh?
- Why, you...!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:51.630
A horse cart!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.470
It's Rasara's group!
Run for it!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.970
- Rasara?
- They're using slingshots.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.600
Please, get in back!

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.280
Rasara!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.280
I'll explain later!

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.420
Can you not go so fast?!

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:14.800
Thanks, Mondo!

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:15.810
Mondo?!

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.160
Oh, don't look at me like that.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.960
Haven't you been
on the Endra?!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:23.500
It's complicated.
And I did help save you, right?

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.510
Judau, isn't this
girl Sarasa Moon?

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.670
What do you mean?
This is Miss Rasara.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.420
It's Sarasa Moon!

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:33.770
Miss Rasara, what's going on?

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.140
I came after you when
I heard you met my sister.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.210
Your sister?

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:41.410
What?!
Then, you two are twins?

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:47.550
My sister has gotten carried away since
she was made prophet of the Light Tribe.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:50.020
She believes war will vanish...

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:52.960
if she spreads our tribe's
teachings throughout the cosmos.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:58.830
But even if we spread Moon Moon's
teachings of light with your two ships,

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:02.520
will the people
waging war listen to them?

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.270
Your teachings?

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:09.410
Our teachings of synchronizing our lives to
the gentle rhythms of the moon's light.

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:13.640
I think you'd be safer
keeping this to Moon Moon.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.750
Why is she so interested
in leaving the colony?

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:21.550
Probably she longs for the olden times
before people came to the colonies.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:27.010
The mistaken desire of one
who believes in power.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.830
We're here.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.670
Where to now, Miss Rasara?

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.270
To the temple.

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:42.580
- The linear subway entrance?
- The lamp's lit.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.140
Gotcha. Let's go!

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.530
Right!

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.980
Wouldn't a flashlight
be more convenient?

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:51.050
Would it?
If this light goes out,

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:54.290
we'll know there are
toxic gases in the area.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.820
We'll go from here.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.390
This way, please.
It leads below the temple.

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.860
What? We're not going to ride this?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.330
It doesn't work.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:05.700
Hang on.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.120
I might get it to work.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.510
Of course!
The power-supply switch!

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:13.670
This should do it.

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:17.980
All right!

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:19.480
It works now!

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.980
That's Mondo for you!

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:24.600
I'm so glad we have someone with
us who's good with machines!

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:27.220
Well, to help you, Miss Rasara.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.460
Or to sell out the Argama.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:32.860
Or to get money by
scrapping the Gundam.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:36.330
- We don't like you.
- We did start out as junk dealers!

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:45.610
They are users of machines.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:49.480
We've even thought to search the secret
underground passages for them.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:54.110
Hurry! Those who believe in the power of
machines will cause nothing but destruction!

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:58.630
That Catl stands as a testament
to the powerlessness of machines!

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:01.850
They are fools who do
not comprehend this.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.260
What of those from the Endra?

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:07.360
Yes! They have pledged
us their loyalty!

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:11.660
Let us have them pilot
the Argama for us as well.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:13.770
We have no choice, then.

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:16.150
We need strength to
spread our teachings.

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.870
I don't recall what we did
to deserve this treatment.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.040
If we resist carelessly, we'll only get hurt.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.880
First their prophet calls us messiahs,
then she makes us prisoners!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:27.180
Cut the chatter and march!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.550
It's narrow there. It'll be
hard to use spears and swords.

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:36.860
Quit yanking!

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.500
I said shut up!

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.060
Why, you...!

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.860
Take this!

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.570
Whew! You saved us!

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:49.470
Hey, times like this are made
for getting people in your debt.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:52.320
Oh! Fine, then.
I'll get myself untied.

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:54.670
Be my guest.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.080
Come on! Untie us!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:08:59.880
Sure you don't
prefer it like that?

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.020
Judau!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.410
Hurry, everyone! This way!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.850
Why is the prophet here?

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.350
Rasara, it's you!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.350
Rasara?

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:09.560
We'll explain later.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:10.890
Let's go!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:16.570
You must lend us your ship so that
we might spread the teachings of light.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.960
Didn't you make a deal
with the Argama?

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.570
They refused us.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:23.200
If Lady Sarasa Moon
becomes ruler of the cosmos,

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.640
we shall give you
a colony in return.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.680
Oh! How thankful
we are for this offer!

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:31.140
M-Mr. Gottn, are you sure about this?

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:35.160
It's a chance to take this colony
without using a single bullet!

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:36.450
Oh...

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.220
Since I saw this colony,

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.650
the teachings of light have
gradually spread through my heart.

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:44.960
To think that I might become
one of the children of the light...!

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.690
Oh! Then you'll help us?

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:52.970
I'll begin working to prove
my determination at once.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:56.970
Go on! Disassemble that giant
machine and take it to the Endra!

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:58.740
Please leave it to me!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.620
The last stop is the port
where the Argama's docked.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.780
What about you?

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:05.710
I'll get the Double Zeta back
and return to the Argama.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:09.350
- Why are you tying me up again?!
- You're the Argama's prisoner, right?

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.250
Take care of this, Roux.
We don't know what the Endra's up to.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.320
Roger!

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.720
Iino, you're coming, too!

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:16.160
I'll stay on the Argama.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:16.860
Nope!

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:18.160
Bye, Captain!

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.360
See you.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:25.550
Okay, Miss Rasara, sorry to do this, but can
you lead us below to the Double Zeta?

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.670
Yes, and then the two of
us will go to the Catl.

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:30.470
And use this.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:32.470
He'll make the Catl move.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:33.470
Huh?!

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:36.830
Catl? You mean that huge
thing next to the temple?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:42.050
The Catl hasn't moved since Moon 
Moon renounced the use of machines.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:47.920
It's been left there to become
a symbol of powerlessness.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:54.060
If we can make it move, people here
may realize that my sister is wrong.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:05.670
Still no sign of either
the Endra or the Argama?

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:09.720
No, sir. I'm just picking up what
appears to be a first-generation colony.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:12.110
What? A colony?

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:15.080
I detect no other artificial
objects in the area.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:18.120
I see.
We'll investigate it!

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.360
Pretty old, isn't it?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:29.730
Can it still work?
Worst case, I'll sell it to a museum.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:34.970
Is that it?

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:35.770
Judau!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.170
I'm going to see the Double Zeta.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:53.050
They're really planning
to disassemble it!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.550
What the...! Beecha's there, too!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:56.860
Where?

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:02.030
- You're taking this apart?
- The prophet asked me to.

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:17.140
Miss Rasara, I'm climbing
up to the cockpit!

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.180
We'll distract the guards.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.950
Okay, then I'll grab the Double Zeta!

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.350
Don't let Beecha beat you!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:30.620
Okay, it'll move. The solar battery
was never shut down.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.090
Really?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.830
Who's trying to stop me?!

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.200
- Saboteurs?!
- Where?!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:45.240
- There!
- Get 'em!

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:55.460
Beecha, what are you doing?!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.800
That's...!

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.650
Beecha, hurry!

00:12:58.650 --> 00:12:59.790
Judau!

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:02.360
Beecha, what are you doing to it?!

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:07.290
I don't have time for this!

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:10.030
Still, this thing is really old.

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.470
But we have to make it work!

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:13.500
It's on!

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.200
Excellent!

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:17.950
Climb the scaffolding and get him!

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:19.670
This way!

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:28.780
- Ow!
- I'll stab you!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.150
Cut it out, Judau!
You wanna kill me?!

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:34.460
Get away from it, Beecha,
or I'll stab you for real!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.960
Mr. Mondo, can't you go any faster?

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.380
Almost there.
Just a little more.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.900
- Okay, Miss Rasara, use those switches and lever.
- Right.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:49.610
Huh? It's not moving.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:51.500
Don't climb up!

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.710
Keep him out of the giant,
no matter what!

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:58.940
Hey! Stop! Don't climb up
any more! It'll collapse!

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.510
Crap, he got in.

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:19.510
You can't stop me now!
Don't get crushed!

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:22.040
J-Judau, stop it!
Look out!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:30.610
Contact the Endra!
Launch the Gaza-Cs to oppose him!

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:33.720
The giant is moving!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.500
- Judau!
- Mission accomplished!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:40.190
- The giant is moving!
- God is angry with us!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.220
All right!

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:45.790
Go! Kick their butts!

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.260
Silence! Calm yourselves!

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:50.460
The giant has risen into the sky!

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:52.160
Where is Gottn?!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:55.370
He says he'll defeat the giant
in the sky with the Endra's giants!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.840
I see.

00:14:57.320 --> 00:15:01.410
That boy...
he's not our messiah.

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.580
Leina! Big Brother's
coming to save you!

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.820
Move!
If you get in my way...!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:14.650
Close the hatch!
The Double Zeta's coming!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.760
OUTTA THE WAY!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.530
Agh! Dammit!

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:31.470
Explosion! A Gaza-C blew up
right below the mobile suit deck!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.550
Leina... Are you okay?

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.920
Damn you, Double Zeta!
You'll pay for that!

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:48.990
Master Glemy! We've confirmed
the Endra is at Moon Moon,

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:50.560
but it's apparently being bombarded!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:53.360
- What?!
- We've intercepted radio signals!

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:57.730
Ready the Bawoo!
I'm going out!

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:05.670
The giants!

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.160
The wrath of God!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.880
Gottn! Where's Gottn?!

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.510
Lady Sarasa! There!

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:15.180
Master Gottn, stop them!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:18.500
Stop the giants!
Moon Moon is being destroyed!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.750
Look at that!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:23.060
This colony will never have peace
until the Double Zeta is defeated!

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.460
That's what we're
fighting to do!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.630
But the giants mustn't move!

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:33.130
All right, this time, we're okay.
It'll work.

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:39.410
Why isn't it working?!
C'mon!

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.440
WORK!

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:56.760
Yes! It moved! Miss Rasara!

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:59.690
Please take us to my sister.

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:06.550
AMX-107 BAWOO

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:10.820
I see. This new model is as
agile as you'd expect.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:14.470
Still, if the Endra's been bombarded,

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.580
then what about Leina,
my bait to draw out Roux Louka?

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.350
Is she all right?

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:35.630
Bridge! Where do you have
our hostage Leina confined?

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.260
Sir! The data room!

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:39.670
The data room? Right!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:45.840
Out of the way!
I don't have time to waste with you!

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.710
Hold him there! I'll blast
him with my beam rifle!

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.290
The Catl!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.180
It moved!

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:12.070
H-How can this be?!
The relic moved!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.870
Im-Impossible!

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:19.100
My people, there is nothing to fear!

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:22.160
The Catl is a machine!
It moves!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:27.550
This holy relic has awakened to correct
the faulty teachings of Moon Moon!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:29.650
Have no fear of machines!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:34.450
Silence! Do not listen to my
exiled sister! Seize her!

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:36.100
Seize her!

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.890
Prophet, the giants!
Please, stop the giants!

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:42.860
Role?

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:46.470
Where are Gottn and his people?!
This is all their fault.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.130
But now...

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:52.620
It's all right!
The Catl will do it!

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:53.940
Go!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.440
Our guardian deity
has been revived!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.420
Now! We're getting
back to the Argama!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.010
R-Right!

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:05.490
Mondo? Take care of this!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:16.230
Leina! Leina!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.670
Leina?

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.810
Stop!
Give Leina back to me!

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:37.080
Stop it!
You want to kill her?!

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:43.120
If you want Leina back, give me
Roux Louka as a hostage in exchange!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:51.100
Roux Louka?!
What's he talking about?!

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.880
He did it!

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.280
Our guardian saved us!
Lord Catl!

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:08.380
Lord Catl!
You beat the outsiders!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.950
And there are countless mechanical
enemies like that on the outside?

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:16.190
Sister, you went too far
by using the Catl's immobility...

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:19.430
as proof that the Light Tribe's
way of thinking was correct.

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:22.330
You mean it would be wrong
to use a mechanical vessel...

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:25.830
to spread the word of Moon 
Moon to the outside world?

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.050
Dammit, Mondo!

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:37.180
Why, you...! You were helping
out Judau and the others!

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:40.480
N-No! Not Judau!
There was another reason!

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.650
Tell me on the Endra!

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.170
Mr. Gottn!

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:48.090
Where were you hiding?!
You were gone when we needed you!

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.260
Wait, please!

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:52.690
It was you, wasn't it, Mr. Role?

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:56.130
You groomed
Miss Sarasa as the prophet...

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:59.870
so she'd want one or two ships to
set out from Moon Moon. Why?!

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:04.800
Because I felt like this tiny
colony was suffocating me.

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:07.770
That's why
I wanted to get out!

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:10.910
What was my crime?
What was so wrong about that?!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:15.900
Was it right to sacrifice the innocent
people of Moon Moon to a space war?!

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:19.490
I don't pilot that mobile
suit because I like it!

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:23.020
My sister got kidnapped by
the enemy because we're on a warship!

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:24.090
Listen!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:28.720
Moon Moon's a colony that's been forgotten
by both Axis and the Federation Forces!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.670
Be happy with that!

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:32.270
But...

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:36.820
But it's lonely,
being forgotten.

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:40.670
The older you get,
the worse it feels.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.940
Oh, to hell with your poetry!

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:46.850
C'mon, Mr. Bright. I hear they've sent
another ship after us.

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:48.330
Yeah.

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:50.920
- I hope your sister is safe.
- Thanks.

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:53.890
Sarasa, it's a scary world
out there. Understand?

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:54.850
Yes.

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:56.190
See you!

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:06.110
It was a nice place.

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:09.770
Yeah. I guess they're sort of
ignorant of the real world.

00:22:09.770 --> 00:22:14.470
But they're somehow maintaining an
ecosystem cycle like that in a colony.

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:19.110
Better than melting their brains by knowing
too much about the world, huh?

00:22:19.110 --> 00:22:22.950
Maybe we should come back here
after I get Leina back.

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:48.450 --> 00:23:52.150
When some old weirdo brings
the Argama fresh supplies,

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:56.110
he leads, of all things,
Gottn's mobile suit team aboard!

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:59.570
Gottn, trying to capture
the Argama in one piece,

00:23:59.570 --> 00:24:04.870
starts a mobile suit battle around the
La Vie en Rose! Damn, it's so annoying!

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:09.470
Next time on Gundam ZZ:
"Melee Aboard the Argama."

00:24:09.470 --> 00:24:11.380
When will I see Leina again?

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:12.800
MELEE ABOARD THE ARGAMA

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:12.800
Next Time
